# Playwright POM Standards

- Prefer existing classes in `src/pages/` — extend methods instead of new duplicate objects
- Specs live in `tests/{STORY-KEY}.spec.ts` and use fixtures from `src/fixtures/` when available
- Locators: role / label / placeholder first (match existing page style)
- **Forbidden:** `waitForTimeout`, fixed sleeps, `networkidle`
- **Allowed:** auto-waiting locators, `expect(...)`, `locator.waitFor({ state })`, `waitForURL`
- Keep assertions in specs; keep interactions in page objects
